oads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Logo\" title=\"\">\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"menu-toggle\" onclick=\"toggleMenu()\">☰</div>\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"/home\">Home</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/ac-service-anand\">Services</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/shop\">Shop</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/blogs\">Blog</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 5px 15px; color: white;\">Call Now</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Refrigerated Truck Repair Anand</h1>\n            <p>Reliable, Fast, and Expert Solutions for Reefer Vans, Trucks, and Cold Chain Containers. Serving Vitthal Udyognagar GIDC, Amul Dairy Road, and NH 48.</p>\n            <br>\n            <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141?text=Hi,%20I%20need%20refrigerated%20truck%20repair%20service%20in%20Anand\" class=\"btn btn-whatsapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.008-.57-.008-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z\"/></svg>\n                WhatsApp Us Now\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Introduction / SEO Content -->\n    <article class=\"container section-padding\">\n        <h2>Premium Refrigerated Truck Repair Anand Services</h2>\n        <p>In the Milk City of India, maintaining the cold chain is vital. <strong>Refrigerated truck repair Anand</strong> is a critical service ensuring that dairy products, frozen foods, and pharmaceuticals from local giants like Amul and nearby industrial zones reach their destination safely. At <strong>Atlas Aircon</strong>, we understand that every minute your reefer truck is off the road is money lost. We provide comprehensive repair and maintenance solutions for all types of cold chain vehicles.</p>\n        \n        <p>Located centrally in Charotar region, Anand is a key logistics hub connecting Vadodara and Ahmedabad. Whether you are stuck at <strong>Vitthal Udyognagar GIDC</strong>, passing through the <strong>National Highway 48</strong>, or located near <strong>Samarkha Crossroads</strong>, our mobile technicians are equipped to handle emergency breakdowns. We specialize in diagnosing complex issues in both independent diesel-engine units and vehicle-powered units. From refrigerant leaks to compressor failures, our <strong>refrigerated truck repair Anand</strong> team ensures 100% cooling efficiency restoration.</p>\n\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/refrigerated-van-repair.webp\" alt=\"Refrigerated Truck Repair Anand Mechanic Working\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:10px; margin-top:20px;\" title=\"\">\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n    <section class=\"container section-padding\" style=\"background-color: #fdfdfd;\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-center mb-40\">Why Choose Us? Pros &#038; Cons</h2>\n        <div class=\"pros-cons-grid\">\n            <div class=\"pros-box\">\n                <h3>Pros of Our Service</h3>\n                <ul class=\"list-check\">\n                    <li><strong>Rapid Response Time:</strong> We prioritize loaded trucks to save cargo.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Expert Diagnostics:</strong> Advanced tools to read error codes immediately.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Genuine Spares:</strong> We use high-quality compatible parts for longevity.</li>\n                    <li><strong>On-Site Repair:</strong> We come to your location in Anand, Vidyanagar, and GIDCs.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> Transparent pricing without hidden commercial charges.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Preventive Maintenance:</strong> Annual contracts (AMC) available for fleets.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Multi-Brand Knowledge:</strong> Experienced with all major international and local units.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"cons-box\">\n                <h3>Cons (Honest Limitations)</h3>\n                <ul class=\"list-cross\">\n                    <li><strong>Summer Rush:</strong> High demand in May-June may slightly increase wait times.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Rare Parts Import:</strong> Obsolete models may require 48-hour parts procurement.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Complex Engine Work:</strong> Major diesel engine overhauls require workshop visits (not roadside).</li>\n                    <li><strong>Distance Charges:</strong> Service outside Anand city limits incurs travel fees.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Night Surcharge:</strong> Emergency repairs post-midnight carry standard extra charges.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Battery Dependencies:</strong> If truck electricals are weak, unit repair may be delayed.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Workspace Safety:</strong> Roadside repairs on narrow highways are restricted for safety.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Brands We Service -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding brands-section\">\n        <div class=\"container text-center\">\n            <h2>Brands We Repair &#038; Service</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-20\">We provide expert third-party repair services for the following brands (Note: We are an independent service provider):</p>\n            <div>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Carrier Transicold</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Thermo King</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Hwasung Thermo</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Snowman</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Subros</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Kingtec</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Zanotti</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Mitsubishi</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Denso</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Global Cold Chain</span>\n                <span class=\"brand-tag\">Local Fabricated Units</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Grid -->\n    <section class=\"container section-padding\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-center mb-40\">Our Specialized Services</h2>\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/refrigerated-truck-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Large Container Truck Repair\" title=\"\">\n                <h3>Large Container Trucks</h3>\n                <p>Complete repair for 20ft and 40ft refrigerated containers. Troubleshooting stand-by motors and diesel engines.</p>\n                <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-anand\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/refrigerated-van-repair.webp\" alt=\"Reefer Van Repair Anand\" title=\"\">\n                <h3>Reefer Vans &#038; Pickups</h3>\n                <p>Service for Tata Ace, Mahindra Bolero, and Ashok Leyland Dost reefer units. Perfect for city logistics.</p>\n                <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-anand\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rittal-panel-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"Control Panel Cooling\" title=\"\">\n                <h3>Control &#038; Electricals</h3>\n                <p>Fixing display controllers, sensors, wiring harnesses, and thermostat calibration for precise temperature.</p>\n                <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-anand\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Technical Details: Error Codes -->\n    <section class=\"container section-padding\">\n        <h2>Common Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n        <p>Understanding your unit&#8217;s error codes can save time. Here are common issues we resolve in <strong>refrigerated truck repair Anand</strong>:</p>\n        <table class=\"error-table\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>Error Type</th>\n                    <th>Possible Cause</th>\n                    <th>Our Solution</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>High Pressure Trip (HP)</td>\n                    <td>Dirty condenser, blocked airflow, overcharged gas.</td>\n                    <td>Chemical cleaning of condenser coils and pressure adjustment.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Low Pressure Trip (LP)</td>\n                    <td>Refrigerant leak, blocked filter drier.</td>\n                    <td>Leak detection (Nitrogen pressure test), welding, and gas top-up.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Alternator Fail</td>\n                    <td>Belt broken, alternator faulty, loose wiring.</td>\n                    <td>Belt replacement and electrical system check.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Sensor Fault</td>\n                    <td>Return air or supply air sensor damaged.</td>\n                    <td>Sensor replacement and calibration verification.</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Buy, Sell & Scrap -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background-color: var(--light);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Buy, Sell &#038; Trade Used Units</h2>\n            <p>Apart from <strong>refrigerated truck repair Anand</strong>, Atlas Aircon deals in the buying and selling of used reefer units. If your old unit is beyond repair (BER), we offer scrap value and can help you source refurbished second-hand units like Carrier 600, Supra, or Thermo King V-series at affordable rates. We inspect all used units thoroughly before installation.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Price List Section -->\n    <section class=\"container section-padding\">\n        <h2>Estimated Service Price List (Anand)</h2>\n        <p><em>Note: Prices are indicative and depend on the model and severity of the issue.</em></p>\n        <table class=\"price-table\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>Service / Spare Part</th>\n                    <th>Estimated Cost (INR)</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>General Service (Cleaning &#038; Checkup)</td>\n                    <td>₹1,500 &#8211; ₹2,500</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Gas Charging (R134a / R404a)</td>\n                    <td>₹3,500 &#8211; ₹8,500</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Compressor Oil Change</td>\n                    <td>₹1,200 &#8211; ₹2,000</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Filter Drier Replacement</td>\n                    <td>₹1,800 &#8211; ₹3,500</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Electrical Fan Motor Repair</td>\n                    <td>₹2,500 &#8211; ₹5,000</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Leak Testing (Nitrogen)</td>\n                    <td>₹1,500 Onwards</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ Section -->\n    <section class=\"container section-padding\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-center mb-40\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                1. How quickly can you reach for an emergency breakdown on NH48 near Anand?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                We typically dispatch a technician within 60-90 minutes for highway breakdowns near Anand and the Expressway exits.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                2. Do you repair both engine-powered and vehicle-powered units?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                Yes, we repair independent diesel units (like Carrier Supra/Oasis) and direct-drive units (like Thermo King V-series) driven by the vehicle engine.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                3. Which refrigerant gas do you use?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                We strictly use manufacturer-recommended refrigerants, mostly R404A for freezers and R134a for chillers, ensuring optimal cooling capacity.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                4. Do you provide GST bills for commercial fleets?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                Yes, Atlas Aircon provides proper GST invoicing for all parts and labor services for business accounting.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                5. Can you repair the insulated container body?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                We focus primarily on the refrigeration unit (HVAC). For major body damage (PUF panels), we can recommend specialized bodybuilders in Vitthal Udyognagar.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                6. Do you offer Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC)?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                Yes, we offer preventative AMC packages for logistics companies to reduce sudden breakdowns and protect cargo.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                7. What areas do you serve outside Anand?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                We cover a 40km radius including Nadiad, Vidyanagar, Karamsad, Borsad, and Umreth. Long-distance visits are available upon request.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                8. Why is my reefer unit not cooling?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                Common causes are low gas, broken belts, dirty condenser coils, or a faulty compressor clutch. Our diagnostic will find the exact cause.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                9. Do you buy scrap reefer units?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                Yes, we purchase old, non-working, or scrap refrigeration units and compressors at competitive market rates.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-header\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n                10. Are your technicians trained?\n                <span>+</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                Our technicians are skilled in HVAC systems and specifically trained on transport refrigeration dynamics and electrical troubleshooting.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Areas Served Section (Collapsible/Detailed) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: #f0f4f8;\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Areas We Serve</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-20\">We provide <strong>refrigerated truck repair Anand</strong> services across all residential zones, highways, and industrial estates.</p>\n            \n            <h3 style=\"margin-top:20px; color:var(--primary);\">Industrial Areas &#038; GIDC</h3>\n            <ul class=\"areas-list\">\n                <li>Vitthal Udyognagar GIDC</li>\n                <li>Sardar Estate (Anand)</li>\n                <li>Elecon Industrial Area</li>\n                <li>Mogar Industrial Area</li>\n                <li>Chikhodra GIDC</li>\n                <li>Lambhvel Industrial Area</li>\n                <li>V.U. Nagar</li>\n                <li>GIDC Phase 1, 2 &#038; 3</li>\n                <li>Kanjari-Boriyavi</li>\n                <li>Sojitra GIDC</li>\n                <li>Umreth Industrial Area</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <h3 style=\"margin-top:20px; color:var(--primary);\">Residential &#038; Local Areas</h3>\n            <ul class=\"areas-list\">\n                <li>Vallabh Vidyanagar</li><li>Karamsad</li><li>Bakrol</li><li>Gamdi</li><li>Samarkha</li>\n                <li>Jitodia</li><li>Ganesh Chokdi</li><li>Amul Dairy Road</li><li>100ft Road</li>\n                <li>Anand-Sojitra Road</li><li>Lambhvel Road</li><li>V.V. Nagar Road</li><li>Mota Bazaar</li>\n                <li>Sardar Gunj</li><li>Station Road</li><li>Borsad Chokdi</li><li>Chikhodra Crossing</li>\n                <li>Hadgud</li><li>Mogar</li><li>Navli</li><li>Napad</li><li>Sarsa</li>\n                <li>Khambhat Road</li><li>Petlad Road</li><li>Tarapur</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n                <div class=\"footer\">\n                    <h4>Atlas Aircon</h4>\n                    <p>Your trusted partner for specialized cooling solutions and refrigerated truck repair in Anand. Keeping your business moving 24/7.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-20\"><strong>Email:</strong> atlasaircon1@gmail.com</p>\n                    <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 97272 57141</p>\n                    <p><strong>Address:</strong> Anand, Gujarat (388001)</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer\">\n                    <h4>Our Services</h4>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/ac-installation-anand\">AC Installation</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/ac-repair-anand\">AC Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-anand\">Chiller Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-anand\">Cold Room Service</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-anand\">Deep Freezer Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-anand\">Water Cooler Service</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer\">\n                    <h4>Quick Links</h4>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/home\">Home</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/ac-technician-jobs\">Careers</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"copyright\">\n                &copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon. All Rights 